  unitName: Dictator Lilly Matah
  unitId: 60493
  unitNumber: 625
  description: Long before the battle between the humans and the gods, there was
    a fearful empress from the Agni empire whose name was inscribed in history. Although
    she was a first-class dark sorceress, for some reason she had a battle coliseum
    built immediately following her coronation. It is believed that this coliseum
    was used to experiment using human strife to strengthen the dark sorceress. It
    is said that the faint smile painted on the empress's face as she watched the
    atrocious battles in the coliseum was considered a thing of beauty by the masses.
  summonDesc: You who have called me forth...<br>I have no interest in you.<br>But
    this may help me kill some time...
  fusionDesc: Being used by someone inferior<br>might not be so bad...<br>I could
    turn this into further research.
